---
description: Prepare one debriefNegotiation evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: CounterpartAction[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Evaluate the observable trajectory and final agreement against learning goals, exact feasibility, and role constraints. Distinguish a good outcome from luck or prohibited conduct, explain missed trades using authorized debrief information, and propose targeted practice. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
